Third-party code in src/port/powerpc64
======================================

The three files listed below come from FreeBSD and NetBSD, copied byte for
byte and never edited. The other files in this folder (port_memcpy.S,
port_memmove.S, port_memset.S and machine/asm.h) belong to libterae and are
under libterae's licence, given at the top of each of them.

All three listed files carry the full text of their licence in their
opening comment. They include <machine/asm.h>. FreeBSD's header of that name
(sys/powerpc/include/asm.h) is under BSD-4-Clause, which is not compatible
with the GPL, so it is not shipped and nothing is taken from it: the
machine/asm.h in this folder is libterae's own.


